        <mxCell id="note-commerce-cart-orders-delivery" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;The SQL migration is canonical. PK/FK/UQ/IDX markers identify columns; CHECK constraints are listed on each table. FK column labels name the referenced table and key. All values are synthetic schema metadata.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Foreign keys to other pages:&lt;/b&gt; carts.customer_id → users.id; cart_items.product_id → products.id; orders.customer_id → users.id; orders.pharmacy_id → pharmacies.id; order_items.product_id → products.id; reservations.inventory_id → pharmacy_inventory.id&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;strokeColor=#8295A8;fillColor=#F2F6FA;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
